                                                "sense_id": "632e10a0-11aa-361d-a074-fb172f79ed0c",
                                                "text": "These included other Niphargus species from deep cave lakes and coastal anchihaline caves [23 ] and Gammarus and Echinogammarus amphipods that live only in permanently watered streams [21 ,24 ]."
                                            }
